        "procedure": "The title compound was obtained as moisture-sensitive yellow single crystals in very good yield by reaction of ytterbium tribromide with sodium bis(trimethylsilyl)amide in tetrahydrofuran suspension; crystals were obtained from hexane solutions. Coordinated THF is slowly lost in vacuum already at 20 °C. The authors report no detectable YbOBr in the YbBr3 used and yields >90%, and propose THF as the oxo source after ether cleavage.",
